@startuml fig-ipv6-header
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
title IPv6 fixed header: fields in wire order (RFC 8200)
note as header
|= Bit offset |= Width (bits) |= Field |
| 0 | 4 | Version |
| 4 | 8 | Traffic Class |
| 12 | 20 | Flow Label |
| 32 | 16 | Payload Length |
| 48 | 8 | Next Header |
| 56 | 8 | Hop Limit |
| 64 | 128 | Source Address |
| 192 | 128 | Destination Address |

Fixed header: 320 bits (40 bytes).
Next Header identifies an extension header or the upper-layer protocol.
Extension headers follow this fixed header; there is no IPv6 header checksum.
end note
@enduml
